":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Text area","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" components tokens are defined with semantic tokens of sizes (from "},{"code":"AllSizeSemanticTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeTextAreaComponentTokensProvider"}],"title":"OrangeThemeTextAreaComponentTokensProvider","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemetextareacomponenttokensprovider","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeTextAreaComponentTokensProvider","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeTextAreaComponentTokensProvider"}],"role":"symbol"}}}